# Provenance

In Minimal, this file may own individual source records. In Standard and
High-Assurance, `../machine-readable/sources.json` owns source records and this
file owns source classes, method, contradictions, and summary.

Record every consequential source with:

- stable source ID;
- location and version;
- source role;
- observation date;
- intended use;
- limitations;
- freshness rule;
- sensitivity.

Generation from Octon establishes structure only. It is not a
source of {{PROJECT_NAME}} project facts or decisions.
